sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant L as Ledger
  participant E as EffectRunner
  participant R as SessionRunner
  participant C as claude
  S->>L: start(item) after the gates and the slots
  L-->>L: pending to running, a session row, effect prepare
  L->>E: effects [prepare]
  E->>R: prepare the worktree and the branch
  R->>L: prepared(session)
  L-->>L: running stays, effect launch
  L->>E: effects [launch]
  E->>R: launch claude
  R->>C: claude -p with --session-id
  R->>L: launched(pid)
  C-->>R: output lines to events.ndjson
  C-->>R: exit 0, result
  R->>L: exited(session, outcome, commits, pull request)
  L-->>L: running to review or done, effects [notify, settle]
  L->>S: Committed
  S->>L: start(next ready item)
